  <project_license>MIT</project_license>
  <name>Ferrowl</name>
  <summary>Fast, private email client</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="it">Client di posta veloce e riservato</summary>
  <developer id="com.creativalab">
    <name>Creativalab</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Ferrowl is a native desktop email client written in Rust. It works with
      any IMAP or POP3 account, opens folders instantly from a local copy of
      your mail and signs in to Gmail and Outlook through your browser.
    </p>
    <p>
      It keeps passwords in the system keychain, groups messages into
      conversations, supports CalDAV calendars, CardDAV contacts and OpenPGP,
      and comes with six colour themes in ten languages.
    </p>
  </description>
